== Gathering & Interactive Categories ==
The interactive map tracks over 2,200 gathering nodes across the realm:
* '''[[Mining]]''': [[Copper Rock]], [[Tin Rock]], [[Iron Rock]], [[Coal Rock]], [[Silver Rock]], [[Gold Rock]], and [[Mithril Rock]].
* '''[[Woodcutting]]''': [[Tree|Normal Trees]], [[Oak Tree|Oak Trees]], [[Willow Tree|Willow Trees]], [[Maple Tree|Maple Trees]], and [[Yew Tree|Yew Trees]].
* '''[[Foraging]] / Tea''': [[Kalo Tea Bush]], [[Kawaki Tea Bush]], [[Mireleaf Tea Bush]], and coastal [[Glasswort Bush]].
* '''[[Farming]]''': [[Flax]], [[Wheat Plant]], [[Potato Plant]], [[Rice Plant]], and [[Cauliflower Plant]].
* '''[[Fishing]]''': River, coastal, and deep sea fishing spots.

